<Item XName="Equations" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>%% Hybrid FSKPSK Example Parameters&#x000D;&#x000A;SampleRate = 10e6;&#x000D;&#x000A;PRI = 2e-3;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;FSKPSK_CodeSeq = [2,4,8,5,10,9,7,3,6,1];&#x000D;&#x000A;FSKPSKSeq_DeltaFreq = 2e5;&#x000D;&#x000A;FSKPSK_Seq = FSKPSK_CodeSeq.*FSKPSKSeq_DeltaFreq;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Sub_TimePeriod = PRI/20;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;PRI_SampleNum = SampleRate*PRI;&#x000D;&#x000A;Sink_SampleNum = 4*PRI_SampleNum; %% Gather 4 PRIs in Time Sink.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;ResBW = 1e3; %% Whether it is set this way?</Text>
<Item XName="BPMgr" Type="BPMgr">
<BPLines><T>Empty</T></BPLines>
